+ * pass flip scan never joins it either. REACHABILITY, corrected 2026-11-21 (the original note
+ * claimed the flip into a live epoch's class was unreachable, full stop; the load-test forensics
+ * and W6 show that was too broad). The honest matrix, by epoch class:
+ *   DECODE epoch, queued row (this test): cannot flip -- prefill admission is frozen for the
+ *     epoch's whole life, and the liveness net, the only unfreeze, needs a plan the governing
+ *     class cannot fill, with the frozen prefill taken as the [R7 tier 0] victim first. Stays
